<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Lydia – Paiement Instantané & Sécurisé</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF 0%, #E8F0FF 100%); color: #0A0E27; overflow-x: hidden !important; width: 100%; }

    .container { width: 100%; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 40px; box-sizing: border-box; }
    
    header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1000; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF 0%, #E8F0FF 100%); padding: 12px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header-container { width: 100%; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 40px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; box-sizing: border-box; }
    .logo { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; color: #0A0E27; }
    .desktop-nav { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
    .desktop-nav a { color: #0A0E27; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 12px; }
    .mobile-menu-btn { display: none; background: 0; border: 0; font-size: 24px; cursor: pointer; }
    
    .hero { padding: 80px 0 60px; text-align: center; }
    .hero .container { padding: 0; }
    .hero-wrapper { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 40px; padding: 0 40px; }
    
    /* iPhone 17 Premium Mockup */
    .iphone-frame {
      width: 280px;
      height: 606px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 50px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #3a3a3c, 0 0 0 6px #1a1a1a, 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .status-bar {
      padding: 9px 18px 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #000;
    }
    .status-left { width: 40px; }
    .status-right { display: flex; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }
    
    . {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 1px;
      height: 10px;
    }
    . span {
      width: 2px;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 0.5px;
    }
    . span:nth-child(1) { height: 3px; }
    . span:nth-child(2) { height: 5px; }
    . span:nth-child(3) { height: 7px; }
    . span:nth-child(4) { height: 9px; }

    .icon-wifi {
      width: 11px;
      height: 9px;
      border: 1.5px solid #000;
      border-top: none;
      border-radius: 0 0 0 6px;
      position: relative;
      transform: rotate(-45deg);
    }

    .icon-battery {
      width: 18px;
      height: 9px;
      border: 1px solid #000;
      border-radius: 2px;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1px;
    }
    .icon-battery::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      right: -2px;
      top: 2px;
      width: 1.5px;
      height: 3px;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 0 1px 1px 0;
    }
    .battery-fill {
      width: 80%;
      height: 100%;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 0.5px;
    }

    .dynamic-island {
      width: 100px;
      height: 26px;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      margin: 8px auto;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .iphone-content { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding-bottom: 15px; }

    .header-section {
      padding: 10px 18px 15px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .balance-label {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: #8e8e93;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.6px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .balance-amount {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1c1c1e;
      margin: 3px 0;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .user-row {
      padding: 0 18px 15px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
    }
    .avatar {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700, #ffaa00);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(255,170,0,0.3);
    }
    .username {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #1c1c1e;
    }

    .actions {
      padding: 0 18px 15px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 9px;
    }
    .btn {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 11px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.1s;
    }
    .btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
    .btn-send { background: #f2f2f7; color: #1c1c1e; }
    .btn-collect { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffd700, #ffcc00); color: #1c1c1e; box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(255,204,0,0.25); }

    .section {
      padding: 0 18px 15px;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1c1c1e;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #f2f2f7;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 11px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .card-icon {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      background: #d1d1d6;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .card-info { flex: 1; }
    .card-title {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #1c1c1e;
    }
    .card-subtitle {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #8e8e93;
    }

    .home-indicator {
      width: 100px;
      height: 4px;
      background: #1c1c1e;
      border-radius: 2px;
      margin: auto;
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 6px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }

    .hero h1 { font-size: 64px; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .hero p { font-size: 20px; color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7); margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .hero-buttons { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; max-width: 420px; margin: 40px auto; }
    .btn-primary, .btn-secondary { padding: 18px 40px; border-radius: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; border: 2px solid transparent; cursor: pointer; font-size: 16px; transition: all 0.3s; }
    .btn-primary { background: #fff; color: #0066FF; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
    .btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: #0A0E27; border-color: #0A0E27; }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }

    .notification { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 50px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-weight: 600; margin: 30px auto; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }

    .info-section { margin: 80px 0; }
    .section-title-main { text-align: center; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 50px; }
    .info-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
    .info-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); transition: all 0.3s; }
    .info-card:hover { transform: translateY(-8px); box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }
    .info-card i { font-size: 48px; color: #10B981; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .info-card h3 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .info-card p { font-size: 15px; color: #666; }

    footer { background: #0A0E27; color: #FFF; padding: 80px 0 40px; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .desktop-nav { display: none; }
      .mobile-menu-btn { display: block; }
      .container { padding: 0 20px; }
      .header-container { padding: 0 20px; }
      .hero-wrapper { padding: 0 20px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 36px; }
      .hero p { font-size: 16px; }
      .info-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .iphone-frame { width: 240px; height: 520px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      body { width: 100vw; }
      .container { padding: 0 10px !important; }
      .header-container { padding: 0 10px !important; }
      header { padding: 8px 0; }
      .logo { font-size: 20px; }
      .hero { padding: 15px 0; }
      .hero-wrapper { padding: 0 10px; gap: 15px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .hero p { font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
      .hero-buttons { margin: 10px 0; gap: 8px; }
      .btn-primary, .btn-secondary { padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 12px; }
      .iphone-frame { width: 160px; height: 347px; }
      .dynamic-island { width: 75px; height: 20px; font-size: 9px; }
      .header-section { padding: 7px 12px 10px; }
      .balance-amount { font-size: 24px; }
      .user-row { padding: 0 12px 10px; }
      .avatar { width: 28px; height: 28px; font-size: 11px; }
      .username { font-size: 11px; }
      .actions { padding: 0 12px 10px; gap: 7px; }
      .btn { padding: 8px; font-size: 10px; }
      .section { padding: 0 12px 10px; }
      .section-title { font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
      .card { padding: 8px; }
      .card-icon { width: 28px; height: 28px; font-size: 12px; }
      .card-title { font-size: 11px; }
      .card-subtitle { font-size: 9px; }
      .notification { padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 12px; margin: 10px auto; }
      .section-title-main { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
      .info-card { padding: 12px 10px; }
      .info-card i { font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .info-card h3 { font-size: 14px; }
      .info-card p { font-size: 12px; }
      footer { padding: 30px 0 15px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="header-container">
      <div class="logo"><img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/fr/c/c7/Logo_Lydia.png" alt="Lydia" style="height: 40px; width: auto;"></div>
      <nav class="desktop-nav">
        <a href="/">Accueil</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="mobile-menu-btn" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-wrapper">
          <div class="iphone-frame">
            <div class="status-bar">
              <div class="status-left">22:50</div>
              <div class="status-right">
                <div class="">
                  <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
                </div>
                <div class="icon-wifi"></div>
                <div class="icon-battery">
                  <div class="battery-fill"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="dynamic-island">🔋 85%</div>
            
            <div class="iphone-content">
              <div class="header-section">
                <div class="balance-label">Solde</div>
                <div class="balance-amount">8,34 €</div>
              </div>

              <div class="user-row">
                <div class="avatar">L</div>
                <span class="username">Lydia</span>
              </div>

              <div class="actions">
                <button class="btn btn-send">➡️ Envoyer</button>
                <button class="btn btn-collect">⬇️ Collecter</button>
              </div>

              <div class="section">
                <div class="section-title">Cagnotte</div>
                <div class="card">
                  <div class="card-icon">🌍</div>
                  <div class="card-info">
                    <div class="card-title">Voyage</div>
                    <div class="card-subtitle">125 € / 500 €</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="home-indicator"></div>
          </div>

          <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 600px;">
            <h1>Lydia</h1>
            <p>Le paiement instantané révolutionnaire pour tous</p>
            <div class="notification">
              ⚡ Transférez de l'argent en moins de 10 secondes
            </div>
            <div class="hero-buttons">
              <a href="/accords" class="btn-primary">▶ ACTIVEZ MAINTENANT</a>
              <a href="/accords" class="btn-secondary">💰 RÉCUPÉRER MON ARGENT</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title-main">🔒 Sécurité & Confiance</h2>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-card">
            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
            <h3>Cryptage 256-bit</h3>
            <p>Protection SSL/TLS maximale pour vos transactions</p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <i class="fas fa-lock"></i>
            <h3>Données Sécurisées</h3>
            <p>Conformité PCI DSS et normes bancaires</p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <i class="fas fa-user-check"></i>
            <h3>Authentification 2FA</h3>
            <p>Vérification en deux étapes</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title-main">✨ Nos Avantages</h2>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-card">
            <i class="fas fa-zap"></i>
            <h3>Transferts Instantanés</h3>
            <p>Votre argent arrive en moins de 10 secondes</p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <i class="fas fa-euro-sign"></i>
            <h3>Frais Inexistants</h3>
            <p>Aucuns frais pour tous vos transferts</p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <i class="fas fa-globe"></i>
            <h3>Envois Internationaux</h3>
            <p>Vers plus de 150 pays</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <h3 style="color: #0066FF; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 20px;">Lydia</h3>
        <p>Le futur du paiement instantané</p>
        <div style="text-align: center; padding-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); opacity: 0.6; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 30px;">
          <p>&copy; 2024 Lydia. Tous droits réservés.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
